# Client environment.
#
# WARNING: every VITE_* variable is inlined into the browser bundle and is
# therefore PUBLIC. Never put a database URL, JWT secret, API key or any other
# credential in this file.
#
# Left unset, the app calls the same origin at /api, which the Vite dev server
# proxies to the backend (see vite.config.ts). Keeping requests same-origin is
# what allows the auth cookies to stay first-party (SameSite=Lax).
# Only set this if you deploy the API on a different origin.
# VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api

# Where the dev server proxies /api during local development.
VITE_PROXY_TARGET=http://127.0.0.1:4000
